><div style=\"\"></div></span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"\"></div></span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 182, 79);\">介绍</div></div><br></div><div style=\"\">太空漫步：由8个行星组成的星簇，每一个行星由8小关（区域 ZONE）和一个boss（星云之主）关组成。人话概括：<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">8个新副本，每个副本分8小关和一个boss关，加上boss的话一共520关。</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">现在有两个星簇，玩家称为简单和困难。</span></div><span style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\">星簇之主：20人团战boss，可重复攻略（需门票）重复获取奖励（击杀一次后可使用扫荡功能）。<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">此游戏模式为主要获取人偶的方式</span>。<a href=\"http://destinychild.gamekee.com/90725.html\">玩偶详情点击这里</a></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></span></span></div></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"\"></div></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"\"></div></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"\"></div></span></span></span></span><div style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 182, 79);\">太空漫步</span></span></div></div></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">星簇页面</span></div></div><br></span></div>左边三个按钮分别是：详情，星云关卡列表，通关奖励。</span></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">右按钮：每日奖励。（通过的星云越多，奖励越多）</span></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span></span><div style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div><span></span></div></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><div><span></span></div></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><div><span></span></div></span></span></span></span><div style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635325153878_26800797.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635325153878_26800797.png\" data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"1000\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 182, 79);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 182, 79);\">星云通关奖励页面</span></span></div></div><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">奖励依次是：（此奖励是一次性的）<br></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span><ol data-level=\"0\" class=\"ol-list-style\"></ol></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">1. 新魂卡一张。</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80); font-weight: bold;\">2. 高级人偶券一张。</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. 史诗级人偶制作材料10个。制作</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">史诗级人偶券需要100个此材料+100w玛瑙。</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. 二星棉花，人偶升级材料，类似天子的经验史莱姆。</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5. 少量钻石。</span></div></span></span><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></div></span><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></div></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 2;\"><div><span></span></div></span></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635326253957_34999510.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635326253957_34999510.png\" data-width=\"417\" data-height=\"788\"></div></span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 182, 79);\">每日奖励页面</div></div></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">1. 每日奖励为&lt;星簇之主&gt;门票，星云一 1星难度十票打一次，2星难度二十票打一次，三星难度40票打一次，票越多奖励越多。星簇之主类似wb，20人团战，可以重复打，重复领取奖励。</span></span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">2. 紫色门票对应星云一，红色对应星云二，通过星云一 8-1-1即可每日获得48紫色门票，通过星云二 8-1-1即可获得48紫色+48红色门票。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">通过星云三 8-1-1即可获得48紫色+48红色门票+48金色门票。</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">越早打完越早领更多门票，推荐提早打完。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635905278077_95000521.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635905278077_95000521.PNG\" style=\"height: 1253.56px; width: 578.927px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div></div><br></span></span></span></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 182, 79); line-height: 2;\">星簇之主</span></span></div></div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">boss页面</div></div><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">类似WB的20人团战，完成星云一可挑战1星难度，完成星云二可挑战2星难度和1星难度狐狸，击杀不了也可以领取奖励（奖励少，而且消耗门票，纯属浪费，打不过就把票攒着，票不过期）。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">注意！天子的装备、附魔和魂卡在此模式下无效！！</span></div></span><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635328468728_97782802.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635328468728_97782802.png\" data-width=\"653\" data-height=\"1116\"></div></span></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635396312569_39469778.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635396312569_39469778.png\" data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"880\"></div><br></div><br></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span></span></span><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">星簇之主奖励页面</div></div></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 3;\">按照所造成的伤害分段给奖励。</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">击杀奖励给<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">人偶券</span>，和一些材料。</span></div><div></div></span><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635328551054_21473396.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635328551054_21473396.png\" data-width=\"578\" data-height=\"877\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></div><br><div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635325153878_26800797.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635326253957_34999510.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635905278077_95000521.PNG"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 92835, "username": "海洋饼干", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/5.png", "description": "两岸猿声啼不住，轻舟已过万重山", "follow_num": 859, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "海洋超人", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 97969791, "content_num": 